response:
storff;
I’m on my way out the door to fly to Denver for the Rockies vs Giants game tonight. Good news: I haven’t had a chance to watch one minute of the game yet, which means I’ll be able to make it back in time. Bad news: I know how much you all hate me when I miss a game.
While we’re on the topic of the Rockies, my recent story about Colorado going all-out to land Nick Swisher drew a fair amount of flak in some of the social media.
